# Every local copy of the real .env, not just the file itself. A bare `.env`
# rule does not match `.env.bak-20260830`, `.env.local` or `.env.save`. On
# 2026-08-30 such a backup was swept up by `git add -A` in a sibling repo and
# pushed with 19 settings in it; rotation was the only remedy.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

/.codebase-memory/
